=== A. NYSE early-close days: freeze is 10 minutes before the scheduled close ===
regular day scheduled close 16:00 ET -> MOC/LOC free-entry cutoff 15:50 ET
early-close day scheduled close 13:00 ET -> MOC/LOC free-entry cutoff 12:50 ET
2026 NYSE early closes at 13:00 ET: 2026-11-27, 2026-12-24
2026-11-27 12:50 ET = Shanghai 2026-11-28 01:50
2026-12-24 12:50 ET = Shanghai 2026-12-25 01:50
honest fill-at-the-close on an early-close day: signal ready before 12:50 ET, not before 15:50
=== B. regular 16:00 close: Nasdaq MOC/LOC cutoffs are later than NYSE 15:50 ===
signal ready 15:49 ET -> NYSE free MOC/LOC: True; Nasdaq new MOC: True; Nasdaq new LOC: True
signal ready 15:50 ET -> NYSE free MOC/LOC: False; Nasdaq new MOC: True; Nasdaq new LOC: True
signal ready 15:54 ET -> NYSE free MOC/LOC: False; Nasdaq new MOC: True; Nasdaq new LOC: True
signal ready 15:55 ET -> NYSE free MOC/LOC: False; Nasdaq new MOC: False; Nasdaq new LOC: True
signal ready 15:57 ET -> NYSE free MOC/LOC: False; Nasdaq new MOC: False; Nasdaq new LOC: True
signal ready 15:58 ET -> NYSE free MOC/LOC: False; Nasdaq new MOC: False; Nasdaq new LOC: False
do not copy the NYSE 15:50 cutoff onto a Nasdaq-listed close-fill; do not invent Nasdaq early-close clock times
OK 9 assertions
